{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cg6baPrfiN2tSGdDv8oDx", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "```\nWe find that the gain from retrieval augmentation is concentrated in long-tail questions. Because the retriever was frozen, accuracy on frequent questions did not change. In contrast, accuracy on rare questions rose from 41.2% to 57.8% (Table 3). Median latency increased by 210 ms per query. As the index grows, retrieval cost rises: we observe that the median retrieval time roughly doubles between the 1M and 10M document indexes. Prior work assumes that the retrieved passages are relevant [@lewis2020], but our annotation shows that 23% of the top-ranked passages do not contain the answer.\n```\n\nChanges: I split the long second sentence into three shorter ones. \"Since\" became \"Because\", since \"since\" can also mean \"after in time\". I added \"that\" after \"find\", \"observe\", \"assumes\", and \"shows\" to mark where each clause begins. All numbers, the table reference, and the citation are unchanged."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1925, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1496, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1925}, "output_tokens": 6, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "19b6103d-cbfc-505f-8dc1-c40cc8379cf6", "uuid": "57eb1e09-fe63-47c6-8d42-d73d8bb7e490", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T21:06:22.389Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg6baPeXBPXaCipZEfHcA"}
